content:
Evidence points to a single operating configuration: TS5003-S31C-SO, 50GBASE-LR, one 1311 nm channel at 53.125 Gbps (50GE), with receiver OMA sensitivity −8.4 dBm and average minimum input −10.8 dBm under the same “53.125 Gbps (50GE) and BER 2.4E-4” condition—not separate modes. Alternate pool values are naming variants (1310 vs 1311 in ordering, 50GbE vs 50G Ethernet, 50.0 vs 53.125 Ethernet vs line rate).

